<title>PORTUGAL: Vidago says unaware of buy offers on stock.</title>
<headline>Vidago says unaware of buy offers on stock.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese mineral water group Vidago, Melgaco &amp; Pedras Salgadas, at the centre of takeover talk, said that some shareholders were studying the possibility of selling their holdings but that it was unaware of any plans for a third party to launch a public offer to buy (OPA).</p>
<p>The board was unaware of any reason for a sharp appreciation in the value of the company's stock, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
